:: And did you succeed? {"position":"100,700","size":"100,100"}
No. The rest of the system was fractured all accross the ship. i was unable to establish a connection with the rest of the system. From what i can tell. youre the only crewmate left alive. you need to get to the distress beacon and send for help. the findings of this mission cannot be lost.
[[How do I get to the distress beacon]] 



:: How do I get to the distress beacon {"position":"625,750","size":"100,100"}
Two ways out of here. First is the main door — straight to the cockpit, exactly where you need to be. Easy access to the distress beacon…But its locked.
Second option: the ventilation system. Longer, cramped, and it doesn’t reach the cockpit.
The door only opens from the centralized AI in the control room. Get there, connect me to the main computer, so i can unlock the door and we can call the distress beacon.
Would you like to see a map?
[[Yes]] 



